# Build lock (multi-conversation)

**Default: compile lock is OFF** (direct `build.bat`, no queue). Turn **on** only when multiple agents share `out/Debug|Release`.

## Global on/off

| Switch | Effect |
| --- | --- |
| *(default)* | **Off** |
| `out/.build.lock.on` | **On for everyone** until deleted |
| `SMARTGIS_BUILD_LOCK=1` / `on` / `true` / `yes` | On for this process |
| `SMARTGIS_BUILD_LOCK=0` / `off` / `false` / `no` | Force **off** (overrides sentinel) |

When **off**: no ticket queue, no mutex, no multi-target split — one direct `build.bat` (`PHASE=all`). Bare `gn`/`ninja` allowed.

```bat
REM enable globally (multi-agent)
echo. > out\.build.lock.on

REM back to default off
del out\.build.lock.on

REM one-shot enable
set SMARTGIS_BUILD_LOCK=1
build.bat debug SmartGisViews
```

## Scopes (only when lock is on)

| Lock file | Covers |
| --- | --- |
| `out/.build.lock.debug` | `gn` / `ninja -C out/Debug` |
| `out/.build.lock.release` | `gn` / `ninja -C out/Release` |
| `out/.build.lock.shared` | `build.bat t` (third_party install); blocks both configs |
| `out/.build.lock` | Summary of current holders (not the mutex) |

`shared` conflicts with debug **and** release. Debug does **not** conflict with release.

## Scheduling (lock on)

- Repo-root **`build.bat`** → `build/config/win/with_build_lock.ps1`.
- **Fair ticket queue** under `out/.build.waiters/` (FIFO per scope; dead-PID waiters pruned).
- **Multi-target** args → one lock cycle **per target**; same ticket keeps priority.
- Aliases (`te` / `e2e` / `m` / `a` / …) are **not** split.
- Bare (no `debug`/`release`) → sequential debug then release.
- **`te` / `e2e` runners run after compile locks are released**.
- Stamp: `out/.build.last_ok`. Exit **3** = busy / wait timeout.

## Env

| Variable | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `SMARTGIS_BUILD_LOCK` | `1/on` enable; `0/off` force disable; unset → off unless `out/.build.lock.on` |
| `SMARTGIS_BUILD_LOCK_WAIT_SEC` | Max wait seconds (default **1800**). **0** = fail immediately if busy |
| `SMARTGIS_BUILD_OWNER` | Label when lock is on (set this) |
| `SMARTGIS_BUILD_LOCK_HELD` / `SMARTGIS_BUILD_PHASE` | Internal — do not set by hand |

## Agent rules

- **Do** prefer **`build.bat debug <single_target>`**.
- **Do** create **`out/.build.lock.on`** when several agents will compile at once; delete when done.
- **Don’t** invent per-agent out dirs.
- **Don’t** use Task from chat A to “resume” Agents tab B; resume in that tab with `继续`.

## Parallelism model

- **Lock off (default):** no serialize; avoid clobbering `out/` yourself if multi-agent.
- **Lock on — Parallel:** edits, `--no-build` tests, post-compile `te`/`e2e`, `debug` ∥ `release`.
- **Lock on — Serial (same scope):** gn/ninja on that config; `t` vs any config compile.
